From 4dfa53cb7ebc3095f62e8843e4607de74d079d90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:46:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(ui): detect pockets and slots on the Model page and
 create their operations

The Model page gains a "Pockets and slots" section: Detect lists the
model's recognised features (app::recognize::pockets_of) and each row's
Create adds the Pocket or Slot that machines it - one CreateOperation
through the command queue, its page opened, one Undo step. The plan
(name, seed, tool-sized helix, feature mapping) moved into
app::recognize::plan_operation and operation::seed_params so the MCP
detect_pockets {create} tool and the GUI create the same operation. A
document change after the scan marks the list stale.

Pinned by pockets_tests::{detect_lists_the_slot_and_the_pocket,
create_adds_each_operation_as_one_undo_step,
a_changed_document_makes_the_list_stale,
a_model_without_geometry_is_refused_by_name}.

Fixes #511

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
